<InfoPage path="/contact/" label="Contact" heading="Contact Yarrwin.online" title="Contact Yarrwin | Independent Site Questions" description="Contact information for questions about Yarrwin.online content, corrections and independent guide topics.">
  <h2>Content questions and corrections</h2><p>For a correction, include the page URL, the sentence that needs review and a reliable source. Do not send passwords, OTPs, payment details or private account screenshots.</p>
  <h2>Account or transaction help</h2><p>This site cannot access platform accounts or approve withdrawals. Use the support route inside the platform you are using. Be wary of anyone claiming to represent this site while asking for money or login details.</p>
  <h2>Before you write</h2><p>Keep messages specific and remove sensitive information. We may not be able to verify claims that depend on a private account screen.</p>
</InfoPage>
